======================================================================================================================
u01 -- the eight cluster/group liabilities in ONE currency
======================================================================================================================
  eta_g = g_obs / [nu(y) g_bar]   ACCELERATION missing boost   (what h10, h55, h56, h67b, h68 print)
  eta_M = M_required / M_observed MASS missing boost           (what h7 and h18 print)
  N     = g_obs / g_bar           Newtonian discrepancy        (the no-modification alternative)
  identity: eta_g = eta_M nu(eta_M y)/nu(y), -> sqrt(eta_M) in the deep limit.  Verified below.
  [PASS] u01-identity the two currencies are related by the stated identity to machine precision over y = 1e-3..30 and eta_M = 1.2..6, so a mass boost and an acceleration boost quoted in these scripts can be converted into each other without approximation   (worst relative departure over 240 (y, eta_M) pairs = 3.55e-15)
  how far from the deep limit the cluster rows sit: eta_M = 1.93 maps to eta_g = 1.398@y=0.001, 1.416@y=0.01, 1.472@y=0.1, 1.528@y=0.3, 1.625@y=1  (sqrt(1.93) = 1.389)

