    support of the 15 rows: lensing 3, pressure 12
    the lensing rows -- no hydrostatic equilibrium, no Jeans equation, no anisotropy -- are CLASH lensing 14-600kpc, Bullet BCG1 @300kpc, Bullet BCG3 @300kpc with eta_g = 3.45, 3.17, 3.15
